{"source": "side_07.mp4", "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 4.66, "text": "You want to try something new, but you don't want to look clueless.", "words": [{"s": 0.0, "e": 0.3, "w": " You", "p": 0.94}, {"s": 0.3, "e": 0.5, "w": " want", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 0.5, "e": 0.76, "w": " to", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 0.76, "e": 0.98, "w": " try", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 0.98, "e": 1.38, "w": " something", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 1.38, "e": 1.88, "w": " new,", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 2.4, "e": 2.64, "w": " but", "p": 0.99}, {"s": 2.64, "e": 3.0, "w": " you", "p": 0.99}, {"s": 3.0, "e": 3.28, "w": " don't", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 3.28, "e": 3.44, "w": " want", "p": 0.92}, {"s": 3.44, "e": 3.56, "w": " to", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 3.56, "e": 3.82, "w": " look", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 3.82, "e": 4.66, "w": " clueless.", "p": 1.0}]}, {"start": 4.98, "end": 8.68, "text": "So you tell yourself you'll come back once you feel a little more ready.", "words": [{"s": 4.98, "e": 5.26, "w": " So", "p": 0.99}, {"s": 5.26, "e": 5.52, "w": " you", "p": 0.6}, {"s": 5.52, "e": 5.72, "w": " tell", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 5.72, "e": 6.1, "w": " yourself", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 6.1, "e": 6.34, "w": " you'll", "p": 0.96}, {"s": 6.34, "e": 6.6, "w": " come", "p": 0.99}, {"s": 6.6, "e": 7.04, "w": " back", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 7.04, "e": 7.44, "w": " once", "p": 0.71}, {"s": 7.44, "e": 7.68, "w": " you", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 7.68, "e": 7.82, "w": " feel", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 7.82, "e": 7.96, "w": " a", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 7.96, "e": 8.1, "w": " little", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 8.1, "e": 8.36, "w": " more", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 8.36, "e": 8.68, "w": " ready.", "p": 1.0}]}, {"start": 9.3, "end": 11.46, "text": "But watching isn't the same as trying.", "words": [{"s": 9.3, "e": 9.52, "w": " But", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 9.52, "e": 9.92, "w": " watching", "p": 0.99}, {"s": 9.92, "e": 10.42, "w": " isn't", "p": 0.99}, {"s": 10.42, "e": 10.68, "w": " the", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 10.68, "e": 10.84, "w": " same", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 10.84, "e": 11.2, "w": " as", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 11.2, "e": 11.46, "w": " trying.", "p": 1.0}]}, {"start": 11.92, "end": 13.8, "text": "You're allowed to ask how something works.", "words": [{"s": 11.92, "e": 12.2, "w": " You're", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 12.2, "e": 12.44, "w": " allowed", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 12.44, "e": 12.66, "w": " to", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 12.66, "e": 12.86, "w": " ask", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 12.86, "e": 13.06, "w": " how", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 13.06, "e": 13.36, "w": " something", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 13.36, "e": 13.8, "w": " works.", "p": 1.0}]}, {"start": 14.2, "end": 15.86, "text": "You're allowed to start with less.", "words": [{"s": 14.2, "e": 14.46, "w": " You're", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 14.46, "e": 14.7, "w": " allowed", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 14.7, "e": 15.04, "w": " to", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 15.04, "e": 15.18, "w": " start", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 15.18, "e": 15.48, "w": " with", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 15.48, "e": 15.86, "w": " less.", "p": 1.0}]}, {"start": 16.4, "end": 17.8, "text": "Nobody starts with experience.", "words": [{"s": 16.4, "e": 16.6, "w": " Nobody", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 16.6, "e": 16.94, "w": " starts", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 16.94, "e": 17.2, "w": " with", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 17.2, "e": 17.8, "w": " experience.", "p": 1.0}]}, {"start": 18.24, "end": 19.68, "text": "That's what showing up is for.", "words": [{"s": 18.24, "e": 18.62, "w": " That's", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 18.62, "e": 18.74, "w": " what", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 18.74, "e": 19.0, "w": " showing", "p": 0.96}, {"s": 19.0, "e": 19.24, "w": " up", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 19.24, "e": 19.5, "w": " is", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 19.5, "e": 19.68, "w": " for.", "p": 1.0}]}]}